{"END": 91.88, "S": [{"id": "hook#0", "text": "The clams in your spaghetti alle vongole may come from the bottom of the Black Sea.", "s": 0.25, "e": 3.677, "words": [{"w": "İtalya'nın", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.752}, {"w": "en", "s": 0.752, "e": 0.919}, {"w": "meşhur", "s": 0.919, "e": 1.253}, {"w": "makarnasındaki", "s": 1.253, "e": 1.922}, {"w": "midye,", "s": 1.922, "e": 2.256}, {"w": "Karadeniz'in", "s": 2.256, "e": 2.841}, {"w": "kumundan", "s": 2.841, "e": 3.259}, {"w": "çıkıyor.", "s": 3.259, "e": 3.677}]}, {"id": "hookQ#1", "text": "But almost nobody knows how they get out of it.", "s": 4.127, "e": 6.785, "words": [{"w": "Ama", "s": 4.127, "e": 4.364}, {"w": "nasıl", "s": 4.364, "e": 4.696}, {"w": "çıkarıldığını", "s": 4.696, "e": 5.408}, {"w": "neredeyse", "s": 5.408, "e": 5.93}, {"w": "kimse", "s": 5.93, "e": 6.263}, {"w": "bilmiyor.", "s": 6.263, "e": 6.785}]}, {"id": "step#2", "text": "Let me show you, step by step.", "s": 7.235, "e": 8.738, "words": [{"w": "Adım", "s": 7.235, "e": 7.611}, {"w": "adım", "s": 7.611, "e": 7.987}, {"w": "anlatayım.", "s": 7.987, "e": 8.738}]}, {"id": "cta#3", "text": "Share this video and subscribe, so everyone can see the journey behind their dinner.", "s": 9.188, "e": 14.154, "words": [{"w": "Bu", "s": 9.188, "e": 9.4}, {"w": "videoyu", "s": 9.4, "e": 9.875}, {"w": "paylaş", "s": 9.875, "e": 10.298}, {"w": "ve", "s": 10.298, "e": 10.509}, {"w": "abone", "s": 10.509, "e": 10.879}, {"w": "ol", "s": 10.879, "e": 11.09}, {"w": "ki", "s": 11.09, "e": 11.301}, {"w": "herkes", "s": 11.301, "e": 11.724}, {"w": "sofrasındaki", "s": 11.724, "e": 12.464}, {"w": "midyenin", "s": 12.464, "e": 12.992}, {"w": "yolculuğunu", "s": 12.992, "e": 13.678}, {"w": "görsün.", "s": 13.678, "e": 14.154}]}, {"id": "name#4", "text": "This little shellfish is the striped venus clam.", "s": 14.604, "e": 17.646, "words": [{"w": "Bu", "s": 14.604, "e": 14.857}, {"w": "küçük", "s": 14.857, "e": 15.301}, {"w": "midyenin", "s": 15.301, "e": 15.935}, {"w": "adı", "s": 15.935, "e": 16.252}, {"w": "beyaz", "s": 16.252, "e": 16.695}, {"w": "kum", "s": 16.695, "e": 17.012}, {"w": "midyesi.", "s": 17.012, "e": 17.646}]}, {"id": "cik#5", "text": "Turkish fishermen call it chik-chik.", "s": 18.096, "e": 20.754, "words": [{"w": "Karadenizli", "s": 18.096, "e": 18.816}, {"w": "balıkçılar", "s": 18.816, "e": 19.48}, {"w": "ona", "s": 19.48, "e": 19.757}, {"w": "çik", "s": 19.757, "e": 20.034}, {"w": "çik", "s": 20.034, "e": 20.311}, {"w": "diyor.", "s": 20.311, "e": 20.754}]}, {"id": "live#6", "text": "It lives close to the shore, buried in the sand, in water less than twenty meters deep.", "s": 21.204, "e": 25.4, "words": [{"w": "Kıyıya", "s": 21.204, "e": 21.623}, {"w": "yakın,", "s": 21.623, "e": 22.043}, {"w": "yirmi", "s": 22.043, "e": 22.41}, {"w": "metreden", "s": 22.41, "e": 22.935}, {"w": "sığ", "s": 22.935, "e": 23.197}, {"w": "sularda,", "s": 23.197, "e": 23.722}, {"w": "kumun", "s": 23.722, "e": 24.089}, {"w": "içine", "s": 24.089, "e": 24.456}, {"w": "gömülü", "s": 24.456, "e": 24.875}, {"w": "yaşıyor.", "s": 24.875, "e": 25.4}]}, {"id": "howq#7", "text": "So how do you get a clam out of the sand?", "s": 25.85, "e": 28.508, "words": [{"w": "Peki", "s": 25.85, "e": 26.145}, {"w": "kumun", "s": 26.145, "e": 26.49}, {"w": "içindeki", "s": 26.49, "e": 26.982}, {"w": "midyeyi", "s": 26.982, "e": 27.425}, {"w": "nasıl", "s": 27.425, "e": 27.769}, {"w": "çıkarıyorsun?", "s": 27.769, "e": 28.508}]}, {"id": "water#8", "text": "With water!", "s": 28.958, "e": 30.158, "words": [{"w": "Suyla!", "s": 28.958, "e": 30.158}]}, {"id": "lower#9", "text": "The boat lowers a steel cage to the seabed behind it.", "s": 30.608, "e": 34.035, "words": [{"w": "Tekne,", "s": 30.608, "e": 31.017}, {"w": "arkasından", "s": 31.017, "e": 31.631}, {"w": "demir", "s": 31.631, "e": 31.989}, {"w": "bir", "s": 31.989, "e": 32.244}, {"w": "kafesi", "s": 32.244, "e": 32.654}, {"w": "deniz", "s": 32.654, "e": 33.012}, {"w": "dibine", "s": 33.012, "e": 33.421}, {"w": "indiriyor.", "s": 33.421, "e": 34.035}]}, {"id": "pump#10", "text": "A powerful pump on board draws in seawater and sends it down a hose to the cage.", "s": 34.485, "e": 38.681, "words": [{"w": "Teknedeki", "s": 34.485, "e": 35.054}, {"w": "güçlü", "s": 35.054, "e": 35.417}, {"w": "pompa", "s": 35.417, "e": 35.78}, {"w": "deniz", "s": 35.78, "e": 36.142}, {"w": "suyunu", "s": 36.142, "e": 36.557}, {"w": "çekiyor", "s": 36.557, "e": 37.023}, {"w": "ve", "s": 37.023, "e": 37.23}, {"w": "hortumla", "s": 37.23, "e": 37.748}, {"w": "kafese", "s": 37.748, "e": 38.163}, {"w": "basıyor.", "s": 38.163, "e": 38.681}]}, {"id": "jets#11", "text": "Jets of water at the front of the cage loosen the sand.", "s": 39.131, "e": 41.788, "words": [{"w": "Kafesin", "s": 39.131, "e": 39.558}, {"w": "ağzından", "s": 39.558, "e": 40.032}, {"w": "fışkıran", "s": 40.032, "e": 40.507}, {"w": "su", "s": 40.507, "e": 40.697}, {"w": "kumu", "s": 40.697, "e": 40.982}, {"w": "havalandırıyor.", "s": 40.982, "e": 41.788}]}, {"id": "fill#12", "text": "The sand lifts like a cloud, and the clams tumble into the cage.", "s": 42.238, "e": 46.05, "words": [{"w": "Kum", "s": 42.238, "e": 42.519}, {"w": "bulut", "s": 42.519, "e": 42.911}, {"w": "gibi", "s": 42.911, "e": 43.247}, {"w": "kalkıyor", "s": 43.247, "e": 43.808}, {"w": "ve", "s": 43.808, "e": 44.032}, {"w": "midyeler", "s": 44.032, "e": 44.593}, {"w": "kafesin", "s": 44.593, "e": 45.097}, {"w": "içine", "s": 45.097, "e": 45.489}, {"w": "doluyor.", "s": 45.489, "e": 46.05}]}, {"id": "like#13", "text": "Give this video a like if it's useful.", "s": 46.5, "e": 48.388, "words": [{"w": "İşine", "s": 46.5, "e": 46.848}, {"w": "yaradıysa", "s": 46.848, "e": 47.395}, {"w": "beğenmeyi", "s": 47.395, "e": 47.941}, {"w": "unutma.", "s": 47.941, "e": 48.388}]}, {"id": "sepq#14", "text": "But how do you separate the clams from the sand?", "s": 48.838, "e": 51.496, "words": [{"w": "Peki", "s": 48.838, "e": 49.218}, {"w": "kum", "s": 49.218, "e": 49.535}, {"w": "ile", "s": 49.535, "e": 49.851}, {"w": "midye", "s": 49.851, "e": 50.294}, {"w": "nasıl", "s": 50.294, "e": 50.737}, {"w": "ayrılıyor?", "s": 50.737, "e": 51.496}]}, {"id": "secret#15", "text": "Here's the secret.", "s": 51.946, "e": 53.45, "words": [{"w": "İşte", "s": 51.946, "e": 52.397}, {"w": "sır", "s": 52.397, "e": 52.773}, {"w": "burada.", "s": 52.773, "e": 53.45}]}, {"id": "bars#16", "text": "The bottom of the cage is made of steel bars with small gaps.", "s": 53.9, "e": 56.558, "words": [{"w": "Kafesin", "s": 53.9, "e": 54.305}, {"w": "tabanı,", "s": 54.305, "e": 54.711}, {"w": "aralıklı", "s": 54.711, "e": 55.161}, {"w": "demir", "s": 55.161, "e": 55.477}, {"w": "çubuklardan", "s": 55.477, "e": 56.062}, {"w": "yapılmış.", "s": 56.062, "e": 56.558}]}, {"id": "fall#17", "text": "Sand and small clams fall back through the gaps, while the big ones stay inside.", "s": 57.008, "e": 61.973, "words": [{"w": "Kum", "s": 57.008, "e": 57.264}, {"w": "ve", "s": 57.264, "e": 57.468}, {"w": "küçük", "s": 57.468, "e": 57.827}, {"w": "midyeler", "s": 57.827, "e": 58.339}, {"w": "bu", "s": 58.339, "e": 58.543}, {"w": "aralıklardan", "s": 58.543, "e": 59.26}, {"w": "denize", "s": 59.26, "e": 59.67}, {"w": "geri", "s": 59.67, "e": 59.977}, {"w": "düşüyor,", "s": 59.977, "e": 60.489}, {"w": "büyükler", "s": 60.489, "e": 61.0}, {"w": "kafeste", "s": 61.0, "e": 61.461}, {"w": "kalıyor.", "s": 61.461, "e": 61.973}]}, {"id": "sieve#18", "text": "So the cage sorts its own catch, right on the seabed.", "s": 62.423, "e": 65.85, "words": [{"w": "Yani", "s": 62.423, "e": 62.749}, {"w": "kafes,", "s": 62.749, "e": 63.185}, {"w": "deniz", "s": 63.185, "e": 63.565}, {"w": "dibinde", "s": 63.565, "e": 64.055}, {"w": "kendi", "s": 64.055, "e": 64.436}, {"w": "kendine", "s": 64.436, "e": 64.925}, {"w": "eleme", "s": 64.925, "e": 65.306}, {"w": "yapıyor.", "s": 65.306, "e": 65.85}]}, {"id": "haul#19", "text": "When it's full, the cage is pulled up and the clams are emptied onto the 