 us in the comments which seafood we should explain next.", "s": 83.346, "e": 86.388, "words": [{"w": "Sıradaki", "s": 83.346, "e": 83.91}, {"w": "deniz", "s": 83.91, "e": 84.304}, {"w": "ürününü", "s": 84.304, "e": 84.811}, {"w": "sen", "s": 84.811, "e": 85.093}, {"w": "seç,", "s": 85.093, "e": 85.431}, {"w": "yorumlara", "s": 85.431, "e": 86.05}, {"w": "yaz.", "s": 86.05, "e": 86.388}]}, {"id": "loop#24", "text": "Because right now, on the bottom of the Black Sea, a cage is moving through the sand.", "s": 86.838, "e": 91.035, "words": [{"w": "Çünkü", "s": 86.838, "e": 87.22}, {"w": "şu", "s": 87.22, "e": 87.438}, {"w": "an", "s": 87.438, "e": 87.656}, {"w": "Karadeniz'in", "s": 87.656, "e": 88.419}, {"w": "dibinde,", "s": 88.419, "e": 88.964}, {"w": "bir", "s": 88.964, "e": 89.236}, {"w": "kafes", "s": 89.236, "e": 89.618}, {"w": "kumun", "s": 89.618, "e": 89.999}, {"w": "içinden", "s": 89.999, "e": 90.49}, {"w": "geçiyor.", "s": 90.49, "e": 91.035}]}]}